config BR2_PACKAGE_OPEN_ISCSI_STATIC
	bool "open-iscsi-static"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBKMOD_STATIC
	select BR2_PACKAGE_OPENSSL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_UTIL_LINUX
	select BR2_PACKAGE_UTIL_LINUX_LIBMOUNT
	help
	  iscsid and iscsiadm, the iSCSI initiator, linked static.

	  buildroot's open-iscsi recipe needs shared libraries, because
	  it links buildroot's kmod and because open-iscsi's build names
	  its own library a shared library. This recipe links
	  libkmod-static, and a patch lets meson's default_library
	  choose the kind of open-iscsi's library.

	  https://github.com/open-iscsi/open-iscsi
